{"id":"huntik:page:2014","page_id":2014,"title":"Darkwave","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Darkwave is a spell that creates a stream of black waves that cause significant damage to the target. Though primarily used by the Blood Spiral, a number of the Organization's Suits have been taught the spell. \n\nAccording to the Suit Handbook, Darkwave is dangerous to use while chasing a target as one's feet would not be firmly planted. \n\nThis spell is similar to the Bladestorm and Bladewave spells also used by the Blood Spiral.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S2E32_Rassimov_Darkwave.png","wikitext":"File:S2E32_Rassimov_Darkwave.png","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Black \n Indigo","wikitext":"Black <br> Indigo","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Offensive","wikitext":"Offensive","links":[]},"first":{"text":"Memory Lane","wikitext":"[[Memory Lane]]","links":[{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"}]},"users":{"text":"Harrison Fears \n Mr. Koskin (TCG) \n Rassimov \n Wind","wikitext":"[[Harrison Fears]] <br> [[Mr. Koskin]] ([[TCG:LGS-078|TCG]]) <br> [[Rassimov]] <br> [[Wind]]","links":[{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_title":"Mr. Koskin","label":"Mr. Koskin","target_id":"huntik:page:15452","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Mr._Koskin","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A15452"},{"target_title":"TCG:LGS-078","label":"TCG","target_id":"huntik:page:10455","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:LGS-078","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A10455"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"re