s":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3456"}]}],"start":0,"end":238}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"[[Rassimov]] used Darkwave in the underwater city of [[Atlantis]], which created a large explosion scattering the members of [[Dante Vale]]'s team. {{source|Coming of Age}}\n\nRassimov used Darkwave to knock out Dante. {{source|The Blood Spiral}}\n\nAfter silently freeing himself from [[Ropetrick]], Wind used Darkwave in a surprise attack. {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"Rassimov used Darkwave in the underwater city of Atlantis, which created a large explosion scattering the members of Dante Vale's team. [Coming of Age]\n\nRassimov used Darkwave to knock out Dante. [The Blood Spiral]\n\nAfter silently freeing himself from Ropetrick, Wind used Darkwave in a surprise attack. [The Phoenix's Ashes]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"<gallery position=\"center\">\nS1E21 Darkwave.jpg|[[Rassimov]] uses Darkwave in \"[[Coming of Age]]\"\nS2E32 Darkwave.jpg|[[Rassimov]] uses Darkwave in \"[[The Blood Spiral]]\"\nWind Darkwave.png|[[Wind]] uses Darkwave in \"[[The Phoenix's Ashes]]\"\nS2E47 Harrison Darkwave.png|[[Harrison Fears]] uses Darkwave in \"[[Rassimov's Secret]]\"\n</gallery>","text":"S1E21 Darkwave.jpg|Rassimov uses Darkwave in \"Coming of Age\"\nS2E32 Darkwave.jpg|Rassimov uses Darkwave in \"The Blood Spiral\"\nWind Darkwave.png|Wind uses Darkwave in \"The Phoenix's Ashes\"\nS2E47 Harrison Darkwave.png|Harrison Fears uses Darkwave in \"Rassimov's Secret\""},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Vague ténébreuse\n|POR=Onda Negra, Onda Sombria, Onda das Trevas}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Black-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Indigo-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","text":""}],"full_text":"Darkwave is a spell that creates a stream of black waves that cause significant damage to the target. Though primarily used by the Blood Spiral, a number of the Organization's Suits have been taught the spell. \n\nAccording to the Suit Handbook, Darkwave is dangerous to use while chasing a target as one's feet would not be firmly planted. [TCG:LGS-078] \n\nThis spell is similar to the Bladestorm and Bladewave spells also used by the Blood Spiral.\n\n== History ==\nRassimov used Darkwave in the underwater city of Atlantis, which created a large explosion scattering the members of Dante Vale's team. [Coming of Age]\n\nRassimov used Darkwave to knock out Dante. [The Blood Spiral]\n\nAfter silently freeing himself from Ropetrick, Wind used Darkwave in a surprise attack. [The Phoenix's Ashes]\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nS1E21 Darkwave.jpg|Rassimov uses Darkwave in \"Coming of Age\"\nS2E32 Darkwave.jpg|Rassimov uses Darkwave in \"The Blood Spiral\"\nWind Darkwave.png|Wind uses Darkwave in \"The Phoenix's Ashes\"\nS2E47 Harrison Darkwave.png|Harrison Fears uses Darkwave in \"Rassimov's Secret\"\n\n==International Names==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S2E32_Rassimov_Darkwave.png\n| aura  = Black <br> Indigo\n| class = Offensive\n| first = [[Memory Lane]]\n| users = [[Harrison Fears]] <br> [[Mr. Koskin]] ([[TCG:LGS-078|TCG]]) <br> [[Rassimov]] <br> [[Wind]]\n}}'''Darkwave''' is a [[spell]] that creates a stream of black waves that cause significant damage to the target. Though primarily used by the [[Blood Spiral]], a number of [[the Organization]]'s [[Suits]] have been taught the spell. \n\nAccording to the [[Suit Handbook]], Darkwave is dangerous to use while chasing a target as one's feet would not be firmly planted. {{source|TCG:LGS-078|LGS-078}} \n\nThis spell is similar to the [[Bladestorm]] and [[Bladewave]] spells also used by the Blood Spiral.\n\n== History ==\n[[Rassimov]] used Darkwave in the underwater city of [[Atlantis]], which created a large explosion scattering the members of [[Dante Vale]]'s team. {{source|Coming of Age}}\n\nRassimov used Darkwave to knock out Dante. {{source|The Blood Spiral}}\n\nAfter silently freeing himself from [[Ropetrick]], Wind used Darkwave in a surprise attack. {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nS1E21 Darkwave.jpg|[[Rassimov]] uses Darkwave in \"[[Coming of Age]]\"\nS2E32 Darkwave.jpg|[[Rassimov]] uses Darkwave in \"[[The Blood Spiral]]\"\nWind Darkwave.png|[[Wind]] uses Darkwave in \"[[The Phoenix's Ashes]]\"\nS2E47 Harrison Darkwave.png|[[Harrison Fears]] uses Darkwave in \"[[Rassimov's Secret]]\"\n</gallery>\n\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Vague ténébreuse\n|POR=Onda Negra, Onda Sombria, Onda das Trevas}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Black-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Indigo-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","categories":["Black-aura spells","Blood Spiral magic","Indigo-aura spells","Magic","Offensive spells","Organization magic"],"links":[{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"},{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_title":"Mr. Koskin","label":"Mr. Koskin","target_id":"huntik:page:15452","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Mr._Koskin","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A15452"},{"target_title":"TCG:LGS-078","label":"TCG","target_id":"huntik:page:10455","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:LGS-078","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A10455"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2